flowchart TD
    classDef check fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#172554
    classDef action fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
    classDef failure fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d

    Start[Observed problem]:::check
    Type{What is failing?}:::check

    Event[Event is not processed]:::failure
    E1[Check worker logs and NATS consumer]:::action
    E2[Check inbox for processing entries]:::action
    E3[Check rule activation exists]:::action

    Effect[Effect is not delivered]:::failure
    O1[Check outbox status: pending or claimed]:::action
    O2[Check destination reachability]:::action
    O3[Inspect quarantine entries]:::action
    O4[Increase publish interval or batch only if backlog is growing]:::action

    Latency[High latency]:::failure
    L1[Check PostgreSQL pool saturation]:::action
    L2[Check NATS fetch batch size]:::action
    L3[Inspect long-running transactions]:::action

    Start --> Type
    Type -->|Event| Event --> E1 --> E2 --> E3
    Type -->|Effect| Effect --> O1 --> O2 --> O3 --> O4
    Type -->|Latency| Latency --> L1 --> L2 --> L3

    Note[Metrics are planned, not currently exported.<br/>Use logs, NATS, and PostgreSQL during investigation.]:::check
